    dct:description "The simulation script(s) thompson/claims/t1917-057_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real unspecified organism specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
